---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AffiliateButton from '../components/AffiliateButton.astro';
import TransitCalculator from '../components/TransitCalculator.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Burgas Airport Transfers (BOJ) & Transit | Burgas 2027 Guide" 
  description="Detailed step-by-step routes to Burgas from Sofia, Varna, and Istanbul airports for Eurovision 2027. Prices, bus numbers, and travel times included."
  breadcrumb="Transfers & Transit"
>
  <div class="container page-content">
    <h1 class="text-gradient">Transit & Logistics Playbook</h1>
    <p class="lead">Don't let logistics ruin your Eurovision experience. Here are detailed, step-by-step instructions on how to reach Burgas from all major regional airports.</p>

    <div class="content-grid">
      <div class="main-column">
        <TransitCalculator />

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4">
          <h2>✈️ From Burgas Airport (BOJ) to City Center</h2>
          <p>Burgas Airport (Sarafovo) is the closest and most convenient hub, located just 10 km from the city center.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Step 1: Public Bus No. 15.</strong> The bus stop is located right outside the Departures terminal.</li>
            <li><strong>Duration:</strong> 20–30 minutes to reach <strong>Bus Station South (Автогара Юг)</strong> in central Burgas.</li>
            <li><strong>Cost:</strong> €0.80. Buy the ticket directly from the conductor on the bus.</li>
            <li><strong>Alternatives:</strong> Eko Taxi (official airport partner) costs ~€15. Private transfers are highly recommended during Eurovision week to skip taxi queues.</li>
          </ul>
          <div style="margin-top: 16px; display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <AffiliateButton text="Book Private Airport Transfer (KiwiTaxi)" href="https://kiwitaxi.com/" provider="kiwitaxi" />
            <AffiliateButton text="Compare Transfers (GetTransfer)" href="https://gettransfer.com/" provider="gettransfer" />
            <AffiliateButton text="Book with intui.travel" href="https://intui.travel/" provider="intui" />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4" id="from-sofia">
          <h2>🏙️ From Sofia Airport (SOF) to Burgas</h2>
          <p>Flying into the capital is often cheaper, but you will need to cross the country (approx. 400 km).</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Step 1: Metro to City Center.</strong> Take Metro Line 4 (Yellow Line) directly from Terminal 2 to the <strong>Central Railway/Bus Station</strong> (Спирка "Централна гара").
              <br/><em>Time: 30 mins | Cost: €0.80</em>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Step 2: Coach to Burgas.</strong> Board a direct bus (carriers: Union Ivkoni or Karat-S) heading to Burgas South. 
              <br/><em>Time: 5.5 hours | Cost: €18-20</em>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Total Travel Time:</strong> ~6 hours.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4" id="from-varna">
          <h2>🌊 From Varna Airport (VAR) to Burgas</h2>
          <p>Varna is the second major coastal airport, about 120 km north of Burgas.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Step 1: Bus 409.</strong> Take public bus #409 from the airport to <strong>Varna Central Bus Station</strong> (Автогара Варна).
              <br/><em>Time: 20 mins | Cost: €1.00</em>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Step 2: Minibus to Burgas.</strong> Take a coastal coach (carrier: M-Bus) down to Burgas South. 
              <br/><em>Time: 2 hours | Cost: €8-10</em>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Total Travel Time:</strong> ~2.5 hours.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4" id="from-istanbul">
          <h2>🇹🇷 From Istanbul Airports (IST / SAW) to Burgas</h2>
          <p>Istanbul is a massive global hub and a very popular gateway to Bulgaria for international fans.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Direct Coaches:</strong> Companies like <strong>Nisikli</strong> and <strong>Arda Tur</strong> run direct buses from Istanbul Esenler (Buyuk Otogar) to Burgas South. 
              <br/><em>Time: 5-6 hours | Cost: €30-40</em>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Border Control:</strong> You will cross the Malko Tarnovo border. Expect delays during peak Eurovision days.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="insider-note">
            <strong>Insider Note:</strong> Use Omio or FlixBus to book intercity tickets in advance. Local Bulgarian bus companies sell out very fast during summer events.
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: 16px; display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <AffiliateButton text="Search Buses on Omio" href="https://www.omio.com/" provider="booking" />
            <AffiliateButton text="Check FlixBus Routes" href="https://www.flixbus.com/" provider="booking" />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4" id="rent-a-car">
          <h2>🚗 Rent a Car: The Ultimate Freedom</h2>
          <p>Don't just stay in your hotel room between Eurovision rehearsals and the Grand Final. Renting a car gives you the freedom to explore the entire coast, from the ancient ruins of Nessebar to the wild beaches south of Sozopol.</p>
          <p><em>Check out our <a href="/black-sea-experience" style="color: var(--accent-cyan);">Black Sea Experience guide</a> to see where a car can take you.</em></p>
          <div style="margin-top: 16px; display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <AffiliateButton text="Compare Rental Prices (DiscoverCars)" href="https://www.discovercars.com/" provider="discovercars" />
            <AffiliateButton text="Check GetRentacar Deals" href="https://getrentacar.com/" provider="getrentacar" />
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="glass-panel sticky-box">
          <h3>Secure Your Ride</h3>
          <p>Surge pricing will be in effect during Eurovision week. Book now.</p>
          
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
            <AffiliateButton text="Airport Transfer (KiwiTaxi)" href="https://kiwitaxi.com/" provider="kiwitaxi" />
            <AffiliateButton text="Compare Transfers (GetTransfer)" href="https://gettransfer.com/" provider="gettransfer" />
            <AffiliateButton text="Rent a Car (DiscoverCars)" href="https://www.discovercars.com/" provider="discovercars" />
            <AffiliateButton text="Check GetRentacar Deals" href="https://getrentacar.com/" provider="getrentacar" />
          </div>
          
          <hr style="margin: 24px 0; border-color: var(--glass-border);" />
          
          <h4>VIP Minivans</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">Need a Mercedes V-Class from Istanbul or Sofia for your delegation? <a href='/vip-transfers' class='text-cyan' style='text-decoration:underline;'>Get a VIP Transfer Quote</a>.</p>
          <a href="mailto:info@burgas2027guide.com?subject=VIP%20Minivan%20Quote%20%E2%80%94%20Burgas%202027"
             class="btn btn-secondary"
             style="width: 100%; text-align: center; display: inline-block;">Request VIP Quote</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    padding: 64px 24px;
  }
  
  h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .mb-4 {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  h2 {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .insider-note {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-amber);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .sticky-box {
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px;
  }

  .sticky-box h3, .sticky-box h4 {
    color: var(--accent-magenta);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>

